    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0496" n="324" xml:id="pg324"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.20235/33</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-09T18:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 9, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 9.16 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>All the papers print Department’s <hi rendition="#italic">communiqué</hi> to the
                    press this morning. Hardly time yet for editorial comment; they seem dazed but
                    alive to the situation. Swedish Minister to a reporter denies having sent any
                    messages for German Legation here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
